(2. Important Concepts) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
0 -14 Td
(- Software Development Life Cycle \(SDLC\): Feasibility, requirements, architectural design, coding, testing, and deployment.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(- Requirement Engineering: Elicitation, analysis, specification \(SRS documents\), verification, and functional vs non-functional requirements.) Tj
0 -12 Td
