(3. Detailed Explanations) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
0 -14 Td
(Rigorous software engineering prevents architectural debt and project failure. High cohesion ensures that classes or modules) Tj
0 -12 Td
(focus on a single well-defined responsibility; low coupling minimizes inter-module dependencies, making software adaptable to change.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(Testing establishes verifiable quality assurance through automated unit tests, continuous integration, and regression suites.) Tj
