(5. Key Takeaways) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
0 -14 Td
(1. Clear, unambiguous requirements gathered in an SRS document prevent expensive downstream rework.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(2. Architectural modularity \(high cohesion and loose coupling\) is the hallmark of maintainable enterprise software.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(3. Automated testing must accompany every layer of development: unit tests for logic, integration tests for APIs.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(4. Refactoring continuously improves internal code structure without changing external system behavior.) Tj
0 -12 Td
0 -7 Td
